      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im on lisinopril for my bp and lately i feel kinda dizzy whenever i stand up fast like im gonna pass out for a sec. i know it might just be the adjustment phase but it's annoying. do u think it's okay if i just take a slightly higher dose tomorrow to get it over with or maybe take it at night instead? i really dont wanna have to make an appointment with my doctor just for some lightheadedness.",
